<!DOCTYPE html>

<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

    <title>Teamtailor — 404 the page you are looking for could not be found</title>

    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Roboto:400,700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    >

    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/error/style.css">
  </head>

  <body>
    

    <header>
      <img class="logo" src="/error/logo.png" alt="Teamtailor logo">
    </header>

    <main class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy u-primary-text-color">  <div>
    <div class="emoji">😢</div>
    <h1>Ooops.</h1>

    <p>
      We couldn’t find the page you were looking for. Go back to
      <a href="https://www.teamtailor.com/">Teamtailor</a> or
      <a href="mailto:support@teamtailor.com">contact us</a> about a problem.
    </p>

    <strong>404</strong>
  </div>
</div>

        <p class="be-happy">
          Thanks for your patience <span class="emoji">😊</span>
        </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
